광명 돔구장 유치 서명운동 (Broadcast News Package) — third-party assets

Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1, subset via the Google Fonts CSS API; licence texts in fonts/OFL-*.txt)
- Noto Sans KR — Google
- Barlow Condensed — Jeremy Tribby
- IBM Plex Mono — IBM

Code
- Brand plate, strap, split-flap tile, stamp, sting and wipe techniques adapted from the Lemo-Opuscar library's news-package demo (MIT, github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar)
- Rendering and mastering tools from the same library (MIT)
- QR code generated with the qrcode Python package (BSD); it encodes https://naver.me/IIDyvaSU (supplied by the user)

Picture and sound
- Graphics only, drawn in code. No footage, photos or logos.
- Original score and foley synthesised in mix.py (numpy/scipy). No samples, no voice.

Facts
- All figures from Gwangmyeong City's announcements as reported 2026-10-26 (see FACTS.md).
- The brand plate "광명 돔구장 / DOME · CAMPAIGN" is the campaign's own mark made for this film, not a broadcaster.
